s="site-menu__list__item__link" href="https://www.raicultura.it/archivio/scienza/tecnologia">Tecnologia</a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> <div data-content="orchestrarai" class="tab-bar__tabs__tab tab-bar__tabs__tab--section"> <div class="site-menu__container"> <div class="site-menu__section__title">Orchestra RAI</div> <ul class="site-menu__list"> <li class="site-menu__list__item"> <a class="site-menu__list__item__link" href="https://www.raicultura.it/archivio/orchestrarai/concerti">Concerti</a> </li> <li class="site-menu__list__item"> <a class="site-menu__list__item__link" href="https://www.raicultura.it/archivio/orchestrarai/eventi">Calendario</a> </li> <li class="site-menu__list__item"> <a class="site-menu__list__item__link" href="https://www.raicultura.it/archivio/orchestrarai/biglietteria">Biglietteria</a> </li> <li class="site-menu__list__item"> <a class="site-menu__list__item__link" href="https://www.raicultura.it/speciali/orchestrarai">Orchestra</a> </li> <li class="site-menu__list__item"> <a class="site-menu__list__item__link" href=""></a> </li> <li class="site-menu__list__item"> <a class="site-menu__list__item__link" href="https://www.raicultura.it/archivio/orchestrarai/speciali">Speciali</a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </header> <section class="section-header"> <div class="section-header__container"> <div class="section-header__grid-container grid-container"> <div class="grid-x align-middle"> <div class="cell medium-6 large-8"> <a href="/letteratura" aria-label="Vai a Letteratura"> <strong class="section-header__title">Letteratura</strong> </a> </div> <div class="cell medium-6 large-4"> <div class="social-icons hide-for-small-only"> <a class="social-icons__icon social-icons__icon--facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/raicultura.it/" target="_blank"><span class="social-icons__title">Facebook</span></a> <a class="social-icons__icon social-icons__icon--instagram" href="https://www.instagram.com/raicultura/" target="_blank"><span class="social-icons__title">Instagram</span></a> <a class="social-icons__icon social-icons__icon--twitter" href="https://twitter.com/RaiCultura" target="_blank"><span class="social-icons__title">Twitter</span></a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section> <main> <article class="article article--video" data-create-date="2018-12-06" data-generation-date="2022-09-28" data-uniquename="ContentItem-05ba8775-82b5-45c5-a89d-dd955fbde1fb" data-content-type="RaiCultura Articolo Item"> <div class="article__video-holder show-for-small-only"></div> <div class="article__container"> <div class="article__grid-container grid-container"> <div class="grid-x"> <div class="article__side-left cell medium-12 large-9"> <header class="article__header"> <div class="article__categories"> <ul class="article__categories__list"> <li class="article__categories__list__item"> <a class="article__categories__list__item__link" arial-label="Vai a Narrativa" href="/archivio/letteratura/narrativa">Narrativa</a> </li> <li class="article__categories__list__item"> <a class="article__categories__list__item__link" arial-label="Vai a Approfondimenti" href="/archivio/letteratura/approfondimenti">Approfondimenti</a> </li> <li class="article__categories__list__item article__categories__list__item--date"></li> </ul> </div> <hgroup class="article__header_hgroup"> <h1 class="article__title">Alberto Asor Rosa: Letteratura e potere</h1> <h2 class="article__subtitle">Da Dante agli scrittori di ultima generazione</h2> </hgroup> </header> <div class="article__video-holder hide-for-small-only"> <raicultura-player data='{&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Alberto Asor Rosa: Letteratura e potere&quot;,&quot;image&quot;:&quot;/dl/img/2019/01/154651777328916772.jpg&quot;,&quot;content_url&quot;:&quot;https://mediapolisvod.rai.it/relinker/relinkerServlet.htm?cont&#x3D;2lvyuKLpPpPlussxwEeeqqEEqual&quot;,&quot;live&quot;:false,&quot;audio&quot;:false,&quot;autoplay&quot;:true,&quot;subtitles&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;dash&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;uhd&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;dfp&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;track_info&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;ContentItem-05ba8775-82b5-45c5-a89d-dd955fbde1fb&quot;,&quot;domain&quot;:&quot;raicultura&quot;,&quot;platform&quot;:&quot;[platform]&quot;,&quot;media_type&quot;:&quot;vod&quot;,&quot;page_type&quot;:&quot;articolo&quot;,&quot;editor&quot;:&quot;raicultura&quot;,&quot;year&quot;:&quot;2018&quot;,&quot;edit_year&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;section&quot;:&quot;video in articolo&quot;,&quot;sub_section&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;content&quot;:&quot;video in articolo&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;alberto asor rosa: letteratura e potere&quot;,&quot;channel&quot;:&quot;rai_digital&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;2018-12-06&quot;,&quot;typology&quot;:&quot;documentari&quot;,&quot;genres&quot;:[&quot;letteratura&quot;],&quot;sub_genres&quot;:[&quot;narrativa&quot;],&quot;program_title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;program_typology&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;edition&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;season&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;episode_number&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;episode_title&quot;:&quot;Alberto Asor Rosa: Letteratura e potere&quot;,&quot;form&quot;:&quot;integrale&quot;,&quot;listaDateMo&quot;:[],&quot;program_genres&quot;:[],&quot;program_sub_genres&quot;:[],&quot;dfp&quot;:{},&quot;nodmp&quot;:false}}'></raicultura-player> </div> <div class="grid-x"> <div class="cell shrink"> <raicultura-share-vertical></raicultura-share-vertical> </div> <div class="cell auto"> <div class="article__content"> <div class="article__text"><p>In questa intervista Alberto Asor Rosa, narratore e critico letterario, ci guida in un percorso diacronico sul legame tra cultura e potere nel nostro Paese partendo da Dante per arrivare agli scrittori di ultima generazione.</p> <blockquote> <p>Il tema del rapporto fra intellettuali e potere percorre da un capo all&rsquo;altro tutta la storia della letteratura e della cultura italiana dalle origini ai nostri giorni - Alberto Asor Rosa</p> </blockquote> <p><br/> Alberto Asor Rosa &egrave; nato nel 1933&nbsp; a Roma dove ha insegnato Letteratura italiana all&rsquo;Universit&agrave; di Roma La Sapienza. Ha diretto la <em>Letteratura italiana</em> Einaudi. &Egrave; autore di molti saggi tra cui <em>Storia europea della letteratura italiana</em> (2009, in tre volumi) e di alcune opere di narrativa: <em>L&rsquo;alba di un mondo nuovo</em> (2002), <em>Storie di animali e altri viventi</em> (2005), <em>Assunta e Alessandro. Storie di formiche</em> (2012), <em>Racconti dell&rsquo;errore</em> (2013).</p> </div> <div class="article__tag"> <ul class="article__tag__list"> <li class="article__tag__list__item"> <a class="article__tag__list__item__link" aria-label="Vedi Incontri" href="/tags/incontri">Incontri</a> </li> <li class="article__tag__list__item"> <a class="article__tag__list__item__link" aria-label="Vedi Alberto Asor Rosa" href="/tags/albertoasorrosa">Alberto Asor Rosa</a> </li> <li class="article__tag__list__item"> <a class="article__tag__list__item__link" aria-label="Vedi scrittori per un anno" href="/tags/scrittoriperunanno">scrittori per un anno</a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="article__side-right cell medium-12 large-3"> <aside class="sidebar"> <raicultura-related options="{&quot;page&quot;:0,&quot;pageSize&quot;:4,&quot;mustNot&quot;:&quot;ContentItem-05ba8775-82b5-45c5-a89d-dd955fbde1fb&quot;,&quot;sort&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;should&quot;:{&quot;tags&quot;:[&quot;incontri&quot;,&quot;albertoasorrosa&quot;,&quot;scrittoriperunanno&quot;],&quot;themes&quot;:[&quot;Letteratura|Category-34ab953f-cef8-4abd-b2dc-12ec7b756f84&quot;]}}"></raicultura-related> </aside> </div> </div> </div> </div> </article> </main> <div class="footer__wrapper"> <section class="prefooter"> <div class="prefooter__container"> <div class="prefooter__grid-container grid-container"> <div class="grid-x prefooter__social__list small-up-3 large-up-6"> <div class="cell prefooter__social__list__item"> <a class="prefooter__social__list__item